WEBVTT

00:11:30.237 --> 00:11:35.672
And he stands up, delivers his poem
from memory, walks out the door,

00:11:35.696 --> 00:11:37.800
and at the moment he does,

00:11:37.824 --> 00:11:39.497
the banquet hall collapses.

00:11:40.895 --> 00:11:42.809
Kills everybody inside.

00:11:43.753 --> 00:11:45.675
It doesn't just kill everybody,

00:11:45.699 --> 00:11:48.681
it mangles the bodies
beyond all recognition.

00:11:49.793 --> 00:11:52.142
Nobody can say who was inside,

00:11:52.166 --> 00:11:54.730
nobody can say where they were sitting.

00:11:54.754 --> 00:11:56.969
The bodies can't be properly buried.

00:11:56.993 --> 00:12:00.256
It's one tragedy compounding another.